塊叉燒，感覺還挺不錯的。\n\n進到店裡之後，右邊會有一臺自助點餐機，會需要用那台點餐機點餐，點完之後入座之後，拉麵煮好會直接送上桌。\n\n面的內容物包含了叉燒、筍絲、海苔以及一顆溏心蛋，味道我覺得也還算不錯。可以免費加麵這一點，我覺得挺加分的。而且感覺加密也加的蠻有誠意的。\n\n結論我覺得如果是在附近需要吃午餐的話，是一間可以來吃的拉麵店，不過店裡面的內用座位不多，如果是用餐期來有可能會需要排隊。",null,[0,135]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzUTJJeFpFaFdWamxFVmpOTmVsZ3lOVkJVYkdSdVpERnNVMDlJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzUTJJeFpFaFdWamxFVmpOTmVsZ3lOVkJVYkdSdVpERnNVMDlJWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzUTJJeFpFaFdWamxFVmpOTmVsZ3lOVkJVYkdSdVpERnNVMDlJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzUTJJeFpFaFdWamxFVmpOTmVsZ3lOVkJVYkdSdVpERnNVMDlJWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzUTJJeFpFaFdWamxFVmpOTmVsZ3lOVkJVYkdSdVpERnNVMDlJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzUTJJeFpFaFdWamxFVmpOTmVsZ3lOVkJVYkdSdVpERnNVMDlJWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,7720,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsQ2IxZEhWVjlEVjNNelgyNVBUbGRuZDFsU09IYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcd08f373c4ca58fe!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOklCb1dHVV9DV3MzX25PTldnd1lSOHc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsQ2IxZEhWVjlEVjNNelgyNVBUbGRuZDFsU09IYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsQ2IxZEhWVjlEVjNNelgyNVBUbGRuZDFsU09IYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsQ2IxZEhWVjlEVjNNelgyNVBUbGRuZDFsU09IYxILMGRlMXR5R0ozM3QaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rb