豚骨臭也瀰漫在兩種叉燒上面，這種風格真的不對我胃口。\n麵體很好吃，可惜沾湯實在是雷。\n還好糖心蛋沒沾染那股豚骨臭，但是鹹度拉很高，我以為自己在吃鹹蛋。\n店員臉部表情大概就比那豚骨臭好一點的沒那麼臭。\n氣氛拉滿單純就是對應時事，吃麵後還能逛逛阿土北新買的商辦和想買的豪宅，這種體驗真的很不錯。\n食物1星、服務2星、氣氛5星，綜合2星。",null,[0,82]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNhbVZIU1RsUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNhbVZIU1RsUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNhbVZIU1RsUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNhbVZIU1RsUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNhbVZIU1RsUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1009342438046655534/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNhbVZIU1RsUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,18632,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3amVHSTlRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcd08f373c4ca58fe!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID7jeGI9QE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3amVHSTlRRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3amVHSTlRRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3amVHSURREhNDZ3dJOXQyMHRnWVE4TkQwbFFJGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRDdqZUdJalFFEhNDZ3dJOXQyMHRnWVE4TkQwbFFJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR_ljKxHPzCM0qCzBhbkkyb01sNGIt\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj607Tyu9KWAxVfk68BHaOwAM4QoykIuwIoDA"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjY_rryu9KWAxUmeV4EHU0kIl4Q0pMFCOUBKAY"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj607Tyu9KWAxVfk68BHaOwAM4Q0pMFCKYCKAY"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GSWEyMHhSVVF6ZEZkQ1ozVjFXVlp5UVVGa09WRRAB",["0x0:0xcd08